{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7001_p", "source_sha256": "76f3ed653a0f2050087335f7b20e878ba6a80041d0930ebefc8ee953433c5f73", "ja": "（桃子のグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n『スライムの子ども』というテーマに挑むが……）", "zh": "（这是桃子为写真杂志《偶像写真！！》进行拍摄。她要挑战“史莱姆宝宝”这一主题，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7002_049mom", "source_sha256": "de5e05edc015ab89d463d2bbaff1a3c4686f1f07b95ecd95bcae5599d327f4e7", "ja": "こうかな？　それとも、こう？\nうーん……ちょっと違うかも。", "zh": "这样吗？还是这样？\n嗯……好像有点不对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7003_p", "source_sha256": "d427ea0869ffd4a65c63fa9c1cdb55f5b94070cce1174755bd20f9fa18d32874", "ja": "お疲れ様、桃子。今のは……何かの練習か？", "zh": "辛苦了，桃子。刚才那是在练习什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7004_049mom", "source_sha256": "906ac0a5338ef25334a6cd7cec6cf10a9c28a3379653c43985032b7629d1fc05", "ja": "もう、見てわからない？　子どもっぽさと、スライムの\n感じをどう両立させるか……真剣に考えてたの。", "zh": "真是的，看了还不明白吗？我刚才是在认真思考，该怎样兼顾孩子气和史莱姆的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7005_049mom", "source_sha256": "ac98f08b1a88b282fb6fae60612258467ff6dcdb6486098155f09eb2241ce5c3", "ja": "でも、桃子ひとりだと合ってるかわからないから、\nお兄ちゃんも一緒に考えて！", "zh": "但是，桃子一个人也不知道这样对不对，所以哥哥也一起来想想！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7006_p", "source_sha256": "48245237bae172ed4f870ac2979cdf91b26b68903167fbf87c7905468964663b", "ja": "よし、わかった。両方の良さを引き出すポーズか……。\nこんなのはどうだろう？", "zh": "好，我知道了。要展现双方优点的动作是吧……\n这样如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7007", "source_sha256": "a8c1703c345098297d6d0b236f1963a9d2814efeffbc1f35c8ee630051cba1d8", "ja": "元気に遊ぼう", "zh": "开心地玩吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7008", "source_sha256": "0b78687e73c7c087f62ebe0163af89e0e2b07fb47d913f6c42e866198aa2bafe", "ja": "お勉強しよう", "zh": "一起学习吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7200_p", "source_sha256": "c70964a5141b3aad289e6e865a5ab618fb44572425755a1bda042d94b333dbe5", "ja": "元気に遊んでいる姿をイメージするのはどうだ？\n子どものスライムっぽく、たくさん跳ねたりとか。", "zh": "想象成精力充沛玩耍的模样怎么样？\n像史莱姆幼崽一样到处蹦蹦跳跳之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7201_049mom", "source_sha256": "9cf66d70ef2f9245a1e0ea80e4f33fee8f044940470d7e90bf0a7c0d5746504b", "ja": "ふーん……まあ悪くないんじゃない？\nお兄ちゃんにしては、いい案だと思う。", "zh": "嗯……也不是不行吧？\n以哥哥来说，我觉得这主意还不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7202_049mom", "source_sha256": "8e0789135048fd7f0be16227e70aec04a7ca0432b0128660e2cff989a146416a", "ja": "元気いっぱいの子どものスライムか……うん。\nちょっとやってみるから、しっかり見ててね！", "zh": "充满活力的小史莱姆吗……嗯。  \n我先试试看，你可要好好看着哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7300_p", "source_sha256": "c70964a5141b3aad289e6e865a5ab618fb44572425755a1bda042d94b333dbe5", "ja": "元気に遊んでいる姿をイメージするのはどうだ？\n子どものスライムっぽく、たくさん跳ねたりとか。", "zh": "想象成精力充沛玩耍的模样怎么样？\n像史莱姆幼崽一样到处蹦蹦跳跳之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7301_049mom", "source_sha256": "5b3d99d4f1bd2e392abba14d63654931ac2a5ce9ca8788362be7b904fe6c9d57", "ja": "いっぱいジャンプするってこと？\nうーん……ちょっと子どもっぽくなりすぎない？", "zh": "是说要多跳几下吗？\n嗯……会不会显得太孩子气了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7302_049mom", "source_sha256": "192fa065a1e4c199d513e0a76db230f0b9e515ef7c8a7fce9f0310d63323a7c7", "ja": "でも、方向性はいいかも。スライムの子どもは\nどんな風に遊ぶんだろう……。もう少し考えてみるね。", "zh": "不过，方向应该是对的。史莱姆宝宝会怎么玩呢……我再稍微想想看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7500_p", "source_sha256": "660db268c2115e043497a31ebc99d6e8fa30706944d8d1cfaa69f52bc62d2b0a", "ja": "他のモンスターに遭遇した時の対処法とか……。\nスライムも、生き抜く術を勉強してるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "比如遭遇其他怪物时的应对方法之类的……\n史莱姆应该也在学习生存之道吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7501_049mom", "source_sha256": "e657e663451b1e674e72f9db2158feeab5b54e1aa961eae7e40eb46feaf89742", "ja": "確かに。スライムって厳しい生活してそうだもんね。\nでも勉強してるなら、誰が教えてるんだろう？", "zh": "说得也是。史莱姆的生活看起来挺艰难的呢。\n不过如果它们在学习的话，是谁在教它们呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7502_049mom", "source_sha256": "0001c58d80501b237d5f24905a900f134af913398a5e12cc4fdeb8ec00097b67", "ja": "先生とかいたりして……あっ！　スライムも\n学校に通ってるのかも！　ふふっ、なんか楽しそう♪", "zh": "说不定也有老师什么的……啊！史莱姆说不定也会上学！嘿嘿，感觉还挺有意思的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7600_p", "source_sha256": "660db268c2115e043497a31ebc99d6e8fa30706944d8d1cfaa69f52bc62d2b0a", "ja": "他のモンスターに遭遇した時の対処法とか……。\nスライムも、生き抜く術を勉強してるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "比如遭遇其他怪物时的应对方法之类的……\n史莱姆应该也在学习生存之道吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7601_049mom", "source_sha256": "10ab05869a644760073a38e426bc9aa05970de28bd9dd300fb57f4285c0db6c5", "ja": "……お兄ちゃん、桃子の話聞いてた？\n子どもじゃなくても勉強はみんなするでしょ？", "zh": "……哥哥，你有在听桃子说话吗？\n就算不是小孩子，大家也都会学习吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_7602_049mom", "source_sha256": "d101131bb1d7804fcf8ea3038ed152ed27bf8c77e5b14d32585f74a9376324c4", "ja": "それに、あんまり動きとか見せられない気がする……。\n候補には入れておくけど、他の案も考えて！", "zh": "而且，我总觉得不太能给你看太多动作……  \n我会把这个方案列入考虑，不过也想想其他方案！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
